			(\hat{Q}^{x,z,\alpha,\beta}_{c})_{\alice \alice'} \approx_{\delta_Q} \Big ( \sum_{\substack{a,b: \\ \alpha a + \beta b = c}} \hat{M}^{(\Point,X),x}_{a} \hat{M}^{(\Point,Z),z}_{b} \Big )_{\bob \alice''} \;, \\
